add(788,'nearest-neighbor-pipeline','Order the1NN classification steps','Which sequence matches the displayed1NN workflow?', ['Store labeled training examples,receive a query,find the closest training point,return its class','Receive a query,discard all training labels,return the largest feature value as a class','Average all training labels before seeing the query and use that value for every prediction','Choose a random training point independently of distance and return its class'],0,'The1NN rule transfers the nearest stored example’s label using the chosen distance.',['This is the displayed process.','Discarding labels prevents the stated label transfer.','That is not the nearest-neighbor rule.','A random choice is not nearest-neighbor selection.'])
add(788,'nearest-neighbor-figure','Read the nearest-neighbor illustration','In the displayed query diagram,d1 to a red triangle is smaller than d2 to a blue circle; with1NN,what is predicted?', ['Class1 from the red nearest neighbor','Class0 because blue circles are more numerous elsewhere','The average of labels0 and1,namely0.5','No class unless the query lies on the boundary'],0,'With k=1 only the closest selected training label determines the prediction.',['This matches the annotated nearest neighbor.','Distant points do not vote in1NN.','The shown task is classification,not averaging two labels.','A query need not lie on a boundary to be classified.'],typ='diagram')
add(788,'euclidean-distance','Compute a simple nearest-neighbor distance','In an explicitly scaled two-feature space,what is the Euclidean distance between(0,0) and(3,4)?', ['5','7','25','1'],0,'The distance is sqrt(3²+4²)=sqrt25=5.',['This applies the Euclidean norm.','Seven is the sum of absolute coordinate differences.','Twenty-five is the squared distance.','One is the difference of the coordinate magnitudes,not the norm.'],typ='numerical',steps=['Square the coordinate differences9and16.','Add to25.','Take the square root.'],formulas=[formula('d(x,z)=√Σ_j(x_j−z_j)²',{'d':'Euclidean distance in the declared feature coordinates','x,z':'two feature vectors','j':'feature index'},{'d':'feature-coordinate units when coordinates are comparably scaled','x_j,z_j':'declared scaled feature units','j':'dimensionless'})])
